---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
---

<Base title="The Agent Relay method" description="The relay method: the loop audit, prompt craft, and the 30-minute relay.">
  <section>
    <div class="prose">
      <h1>The method</h1>
      <p class="muted">
        Agent Relay is built from a few plain beliefs: the human should not be
        the hallway, state belongs somewhere inspectable, a task is not a
        prompt, and receipts beat vibes. Three guides put that to work.
      </p>

      <h2><a href={`${base}/method/relay-loop-audit/`}>01 · The Relay Loop Audit</a></h2>
      <p>
        A handoff is ready to leave the chat when work can move to the next
        actor with no spoken explanation from you. The audit is the one pass
        that checks it — nine questions, each mapped to a part of the task
        record. Any “no” is the gap to fix before you hand off.
      </p>

      <h2><a href={`${base}/method/prompt-craft/`}>02 · Prompt Craft</a></h2>
      <p>
        Prompting is not one skill you sharpen — it's a climb. Ask gets an
        answer. Frame grounds it in real source. Bound makes it safe to run
        unattended. Hand off lets the work leave the chat entirely. Climb only
        as high as the work has to travel.
      </p>

      <h2><a href={`${base}/method/thirty-minute-relay/`}>03 · The 30-Minute Relay</a></h2>
      <p>
        You don't need a project to start a relay. You need one real handoff
        and thirty minutes — six five-minute blocks from a named workspace to a
        live dashboard. If it doesn't fit in thirty minutes, the first task was
        too big. Shrink the task, not the method.
      </p>

      <h2>Start now</h2>
      <p>
        The kit — CLI, templates, adapters, and protocol — is free and open.
        Grab it and run your first relay:
      </p>
      <p>
        <a href="https://github.com/The-Little-AI-Company/open-work-relay">Get the kit on GitHub &rarr;</a>
      </p>
      <p>Two short commands, no flags:</p>
      <div class="terminal" style="max-width:none">
        <div class="terminal-bar">
          <span></span><span></span><span></span>
          <span class="label">relay</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code><span class="c-prompt">$</span> <span class="c-cmd">relay init "Client Ops Relay"</span>
<span class="c-prompt">$</span> <span class="c-cmd">relay dashboard</span></code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
